  - `pointsJson` (stroke geometry) is FIELD-ENCRYPTED at rest now — title/extractedText/textContent/pointsJson are all encrypted fields (`saveStrokesForPage`, NoteRepository.kt); the Phase 02 restore re-key gap is closed.
  - "Sync" = WebDAV upload/download of ENCRYPTED backup archives to/from the user's own server (`WebDavSyncService.kt`, HTTPS enforced, HTTP only with explicit opt-in for local-network hosts), reachable from HomeScreen's ⋮ menu via `WebDavSyncDialog` — Phase 14 FIXED the previously-dead menu trigger; AGSL wet-mixing is WIRED through `WetBrushEngine` in `AnnotationCanvas` (gated by `ShaderCapabilityHelper.isAgslSupported` + the `gpuWetBrushesEnabled` setting, verified in the Phase 14 audit); pressure/tilt/timestamp are captured via the official raw-MotionEvent bridge (`pointerInteropFilter`, no reflection); FLAG_SECURE is applied in non-debug builds; R8 minify is ON in release; baseline-profile TOOLCHAIN is WIRED since phase-199 (`:baselineprofile` producer + consumer plugin + pinned profileinstaller + R8 fullMode + shrinkResources) but no profile is generated/committed yet — the guarded `compileArtProfile` stopgap stays active until a real profile lands (see `workspace/phase-199/REPORT.md`; the old dead `baseline-prof.txt` was deleted in the Phase 03 honesty audit). Phase-199 second review-fix round (2026-08-28) completed the producer's lockfile entries and wired `app/build.gradle.kts` `baselineProfile { from(project(":baselineprofile")) }` so `gradle :app:generateBaselineProfile` plans the real producer chain — run it (and any `:baselineprofile:*` producer task) with `--no-configuration-cache`, since the repo sets `org.gradle.configuration-cache=true` and AGP's `CheckAarMetadataTask`/`checkTestedAppObfuscation` fields aren't config-cache-serializable.
